<section class="tl-hero"><div class="tl-blob b1" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="tl-blob b2" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="tl-w"><p class="tl-ey">A studio guide to grip socks</p><h1 aria-label="Toeless"><span style="--i:0">T</span><span style="--i:1">O</span><span style="--i:2">E</span><span style="--i:3">L</span><span style="--i:4">E</span><span style="--i:5">S</span><span style="--i:6">S</span></h1><p class="tl-hero-p">Grip underfoot, freedom for the toes. Everything about toeless socks for Pilates, barre, yoga and dance.</p><div class="tl-ars"><figure class="tl-ar tl-ar0 pxw"><img data-px=".06" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1697060739671-586c21fa5e30?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=860&q=75" alt="a woman stretching on a mat beside tall windows" width="620" height="860" fetchpriority="high"></figure><figure class="tl-ar tl-ar1 pxw"><img data-px=".14" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1747238415033-b74eec07eb59?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=860&q=75" alt="a Pilates reformer studio with arched mirrors" width="620" height="860" fetchpriority="high"></figure><figure class="tl-ar tl-ar2 pxw"><img data-px=".22" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1747239202356-764770773c9a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=860&q=75" alt="a woman holding a balance on a reformer in an arched studio" width="620" height="860" fetchpriority="high"></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="tl-st"><div class="tl-w tl-st-g"><p class="tl-ey">Why toeless</p><p class="tl-st-t" id="st-t"><span>Toeless</span> <span>socks</span> <span>leave</span> <span>your</span> <span>toes</span> <span>bare</span> <span>so</span> <span>they</span> <span>can</span> <span>spread,</span> <span>grip</span> <span>and</span> <span>balance</span> <span>the</span> <span>way</span> <span>they</span> <span>were</span> <span>built</span> <span>to,</span> <span>while</span> <span>silicone</span> <span>dots</span> <span>underneath</span> <span>stop</span> <span>you</span> <span>sliding</span> <span>on</span> <span>the</span> <span>reformer,</span> <span>the</span> <span>mat</span> <span>or</span> <span>the</span> <span>studio</span> <span>floor.</span></p></div></section>

<section class="tl-s tl-fd" id="finder"><div class="tl-w"><div class="tl-fd-h"><p class="tl-ey">Tool one</p><h2 class="rv">The grip finder</h2><p class="tl-p">Tell us what you practise and what you stand on. We will suggest a cut, a grip pattern and what to look for.</p></div>
<div class="tl-fd-g"><div class="tl-fd-c"><fieldset><legend>I practise</legend><div class="tl-pills" id="fd-a"><button type="button" data-v="reformer" class="on">Reformer Pilates</button><button type="button" data-v="mat">Mat Pilates</button><button type="button" data-v="barre">Barre</button><button type="button" data-v="yoga">Yoga</button><button type="button" data-v="dance">Dance</button><button type="button" data-v="home">Home &amp; lounging</button></div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>On a floor of</legend><div class="tl-pills" id="fd-f"><button type="button" data-v="wood" class="on">Wood</button><button type="button" data-v="mat">Studio mat</button><button type="button" data-v="tile">Tile or vinyl</button></div></fieldset><figure class="tl-fd-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1619575633397-fb4b20cc2465?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=360&q=75" alt="white sport socks with stripes worn with sneakers in hand" width="620" height="360" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
<div class="tl-fd-o"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 300" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="sk"><path id="fd-sp" d="M70 20h80v120c0 30 40 40 40 80 0 35-30 60-75 60H80c-40 0-55-30-55-60 0-45 45-55 45-90z"/></clipPath></defs><path id="fd-so" class="sock" d="M70 20h80v120c0 30 40 40 40 80 0 35-30 60-75 60H80c-40 0-55-30-55-60 0-45 45-55 45-90z"/><path class="cuff" d="M70 20h80v26H70z"/><g clip-path="url(#sk)" id="fd-dots"></g><path id="fd-toe" class="toe"/></svg>
<div aria-live="polite" id="fd-r"></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="tl-s tl-br" id="breathe"><div class="tl-w tl-br-g"><div><p class="tl-ey">Tool two</p><h2 class="rv">Breath pacer</h2><p class="tl-p">Pilates teachers cue the breath as much as the movement. Pick a pattern and follow the circle: it grows as you breathe in and softens as you breathe out.</p>
<div class="tl-pills" id="br-p"><button type="button" data-p="3,0,3,0" class="on">Lateral 3 &middot; 3</button><button type="button" data-p="4,4,4,4">Box 4 &middot; 4 &middot; 4 &middot; 4</button><button type="button" data-p="4,0,6,0">Calm 4 &middot; 6</button></div>
<button type="button" class="tl-btn" id="br-go">Start</button><p class="tl-br-n">Breaths completed: <b id="br-c">0</b></p><figure class="tl-br-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1763403921315-f2ef8697199f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=360&q=75" alt="a group mat class lifting their legs" width="620" height="360" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
<div class="tl-br-v"><div class="tl-orb" id="br-o"><span id="br-l">Ready</span><b id="br-s"></b></div><div class="tl-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="tl-s tl-gl"><div class="tl-w tl-gl-h"><p class="tl-ey">In the studio</p><h2 class="rv">Where toes go free</h2><p class="tl-p">Drag to explore</p></div><div class="hs tl-hs"><figure class="tl-gc"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1747239685045-fcbcf98985db?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a woman in a plank on a Pilates reformer" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>01</span>Reformer plank</figcaption></figure><figure class="tl-gc"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1747237602396-20cb5331ee7b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a hand holding a reformer strap" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>02</span>Strap work</figcaption></figure><figure class="tl-gc"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1711023288483-70edc32c2694?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a row of dancers' feet in soft shoes at the barre" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>03</span>Barre line</figcaption></figure><figure class="tl-gc"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1630649533393-4ee7913b08c9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=700&q=75" alt="a dancer stretching at a barre against a brick wall" width="520" height="700" loading="lazy"><figcaption><span>04</span>Barre stretch</figcaption></figure></div></section>

<section class="tl-five"><div class="tl-w tl-five-g stg"><div class="rv"><b data-count="5">5</b><span>toes free to spread and balance</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="2">2</b><span>common cuts: full toeless and half toe</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="30">30</b><small>&deg;C</small><span>a gentle wash that keeps grips tacky</span></div></div></section>

